<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>World Stats Hub - Live Football Scores, Fixtures & Results</title>
<meta name="description" content="Live football scores, fixtures, results and standings for EPL, LaLiga, Serie A, Bundesliga, Ligue 1. Updated hourly.">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
body{background:#0a0f1e;color:white}
header{background:#111a33;padding:15px;text-align:center;position:sticky;top:0}
header h1{font-size:26px} header h1 span{color:#22ff88}
header p{font-size:13px;color:#aaa}
nav{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:15px;background:#0f1a3a;padding:10px}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px}
.ad{background:#1a2342;border:1px dashed #444;text-align:center;padding:20px;margin:15px;border-radius:10px;color:#888;font-size:13px}
.container{max-width:800px;margin:auto;padding:10px}
.card{background:#141d3a;border-radius:12px;padding:15px;margin-bottom:15px}
.card h2{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:10px}
.match{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #222}
.match:last-child{border:none}
.score{font-weight:bold;color:#22ff88}
.btn{display:block;background:#22ff88;color:black;text-align:center;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;margin:15px 0}
footer{text-align:center;color:#777;padding:20px;font-size:12px}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<h1>🌍 WORLD <span>STATS HUB</span> 📊</h1>
<p>Live Scores • Fixtures • Results • Standings | Updated Hourly</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="index.html">Today</a>
<a href="#fixtures">Fixtures</a>
<a href="#results">Results</a>
<a href="#news">News</a>
</nav>

<div class="container">
<div class="ad">AD SPACE - 728x90<br>Advertise Here - Contact @WorldStatsHub</div>

<a class="btn" href="https://t.me/WorldStatsHub">📲 Join Us On Telegram For Faster Updates</a>

<div class="card" id="fixtures">
<h2>⚽ Today's Fixtures & Live Scores</h2>
<div id="matches">Loading scores... If this stays here, check back in 1 hour - bot updates hourly.</div>
<p style="font-size:12px;color:#888;margin-top:10px" id="updated">Last updated: -</p>
</div>

<div class="ad">AD SPACE - In Between Scores<br>Your Betting Brand Here</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>🏆 Top Leagues</h2>
<div class="match"><span>🏴󐁧󐁢󐁥󐁮󐁧󐁿 English Premier League</span><span>→</span></div>
<div class="match"><span>🇪🇸 LaLiga Spain</span><span>→</span></div>
<div class="match"><span>🇮🇹 Serie A Italy</span><span>→</span></div>
<div class="match"><span>🇩🇪 Bundesliga Germany</span><span>→</span></div>
<div class="match"><span>🇫🇷 Ligue 1 France</span><span>→</span></div>
</div>

<div class="card" id="news">
<h2>📰 Latest Football News</h2>
<p><b>Arsenal vs Chelsea: Saka In Fine Form</b><br><span style="color:#aaa;font-size:13px">Arsenal continue their title push as Saka scores again. Full stats on our Telegram.</span></p><br>
<p><b>Why Your Team Needs A Striker In January</b><br><span style="color:#aaa;font-size:13px">We break down goals per game for Top 5 leagues.</span></p>
</div>

<div class="ad">AD SPACE - Bottom Banner</div>

<a class="btn" href="https://t.me/WorldStatsHub">Follow @WorldStatsHub 📊</a>

</div>
<footer>© 2026 World Stats Hub - Built in Port Harcourt, Nigeria<br>Contact: @WorldStatsHub on Telegram</footer>

<script>
fetch('scores.json')
.then(r=>r.json())
.then(data=>{
  document.getElementById('updated').innerText = 'Last updated: ' + (data.updated || '');
  let html = '';
  if(!data.matches || data.matches.length===0){ html = 'No games today. Check fixtures tomorrow.'; }
  else{
    data.matches.forEach(m=>{
      html += `<div class="match"><span>${m.home} vs ${m.away}</span><span class="score">${m.score} • ${m.time}</span></div>`;
    });
  }
  document.getElementById('matches').innerHTML = html;
})
.catch(e=>{ document.getElementById('matches').innerHTML = 'Scores loading soon... Join Telegram for instant updates.'; });
</script>
</body>
</html>
